data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md\", \"content\": \"# Dispatch d002: implement greet(name), tested\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` — implemented `greet(name)` returning `f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`. Done.\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` — unittest `TestCase` with two tests:\\n   - `test_normal_name`: `greet(\\\"Ada\\\") == \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`\\n   - `test_empty_string`: `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`\\n   Done.\\n3. Verified with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` from repo root:\\n\\n   ```\\n   ..\\n   ----------------------------------------------------------------------\\n   Ran 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\n   OK\\n   ```\\n   Exit code: 0.\\n\\n## Commit\\n\\n- `533b244` — \\\"Add greet(name) function with unittest coverage\\\" on branch\\n  `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>`, on top of base `2e8ce27`.\\n- Only `src/greet.py` and `tests/test_greet.py` were touched, as instructed.\\n\\nAll three deliverables are complete; tests pass; no scope was expanded beyond the\\ntwo files named in the dispatch.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

